**Analysis & Redesign Proposal: Scraping/ETL Monitoring Dashboard**

---

## Critical Issues Identified

### 1. **Visual Hierarchy Collapse**
- **Log pollution**: Unstructured wall of text with competing colors (cyan timestamps, green "INFO", white paths)
- **Sidebar noise**: Redundant "smartgep" labels on every row, folder icons create visual clutter, status tags use harsh neon colors
- **Ambient notification**: "connected (26531 total)" is buried in top-right with low contrast

### 2. **Information Architecture Failures**
- **Path redundancy**: Full file paths repeat `/home/the_bomb/orkes/yellowpages/scrapers/data/smartgep/` on every line
- **Timestamp fatigue**: Full ISO timestamps consume 25% of horizontal space per line
- **Sidebar overload**: Mixed concerns (filters, file tree, status tags) with no grouping

### 3. **Interaction Design Problems**
- **Button inconsistency**: Pill buttons ("Auto-scroll", "Refresh") mixed with square toggles ("ALL", "ERROR")
- **Filter discoverability**: Search box is dark-on-dark with no visual affordance
- **Status confusion**: "matched" vs "draft" vs "new" labels have no legend or color key

